ts/assay-replay-agent.mjs:36-48` (`ENGINE_SOURCE_INPUTS`, read from the code), `b116a45be` + `3d9484a61` (the two movements, `package.json` only), `assets/engine-era.json` (era 5, pin unchanged). GATE: owner ruling on F-2416-2(ii) — unchanged, and this row supplies only fresh recurrence evidence for it. Prior: F-2432-3, F-2417-1, F-2416-2, F-2408-1, F-1300-4, F-1460-1.
